    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@$\\mathbb{K}$,Type),Type.annotation(@V,Type),LA.Field($\\mathbb{K}$),LA.VectorSpace(V,$\\mathbb{K}$),Type.annotation(@ι,Type),Type.annotation(@hf,$\\mathrm{Fintype}\\ \\iota$),Type.annotation(@b,Module.Basis(ι,$\\mathbb{K}$,V)),Type.annotation(@x,V)),theorem($\\sum_{i} (b.\\mathrm{repr}\\ x)\\,i \\cdot b_i = x$))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "zh-CN",
        "values": {
          "zh-CN": "对有限基 $b$，每个向量按坐标展开：$x=\\sum_i[x]_{b,i}\\,b_i$（Lean 中 `Module.Basis.sum_repr b x`，需 `[Fintype ι]`）。",
          "en": "For a finite basis $b$ every vector expands in coordinates: $x=\\sum_i[x]_{b,i}\\,b_i$ (Lean `Module.Basis.sum_repr b x`, requiring `[Fintype ι]`)."
        }
      }
